     "claim": "The displayed products are computed by [F2]: $1342\\cdot s_1=3142$, $1342\\cdot s_2=1432$, $1342\\cdot s_3=1324$, $1423\\cdot s_2=1243$, $4132\\cdot s_1=1432$, $4132\\cdot s_2=4312$, $1432\\cdot s_3=1423$ and $4123\\cdot s_2=4213$. Their inversion numbers, computed with [F3] and equal to the lengths by [F1], are: $\\ell(1342)=2$, $\\ell(1423)=2$, $\\ell(4132)=4$, $\\ell(1432)=3$, $\\ell(4123)=3$, $\\ell(3142)=3$, $\\ell(1324)=1$, $\\ell(1243)=1$, $\\ell(4312)=5$ and $\\ell(4213)=4$.",
